flowchart TB
  U[User] --> UI[Web / Desktop UI]
  UI --> API[FastAPI]
  API --> LG[LangGraph Runtime]
  subgraph Online[Online Inference]
    LG --> LP[Load Profile]
    LP --> MR[Retrieve Memories]
    MR --> CB[Build Personalized Context]
    CB --> AN[Agent / LLM]
    AN --> RESP[Response]
  end
  subgraph Evolution[Memory Evolution]
    RESP --> OBS[Interaction Observer]
    OBS --> EX[Memory Extractor]
    EX --> VAL[Validator]
    VAL --> MU[Memory Updater]
    MU --> DB[(SQLite WAL)]
    MU --> PB[Profile Builder]
    PB --> DB
  end
  DB --> LP
  DB --> MR
